# Twilio logging & marketing SMS delivery (follow-up)

Design notes only (not FloqAi help). Resume: `@twilio-log$` / `@ad-pay$`.

## Why Club Admin “Send test” showed sent but no SMS

1. `sendClubMarketingCampaign` marked the campaign `status: "sent"` even when Twilio returned **dry-run** (`ok: true` with missing secrets/From).
2. Credits were debited **before** Twilio accepted the message.
3. A second click threw **Campaign already sent.** — matching the screenshot status.
4. Spot ad · RydR interstitial templates often had empty `smsBody`, so copy relied on placeholders (`{{club}}`) without fill.

## Fix contract

- Test send (`broadcast: false`, default from Club Admin) may **retest**; status becomes `tested` / stays `draft` on dry-run/fail.
- Debit SMS/WhatsApp credits **only** for real Twilio accepts (`ok && !dryRun`).
- Fill `{{club}}` / `{{event}}` from `clubLocations` + campaign headline at send time.
- Compose SMS from eyebrow/headline/body/cta when `smsBody` is empty; append STOP language.

## Logging collections (GRC)

Same standard as Mail Logging: **ISO/IEC 27001:2022 A.8.15** (+ SOC 2 CC6/CC7, NIST 800-53 AU).

| Collection | Feature |
|---|---|
| `twilioSmsLogs` | Outbound SMS |
| `twilioWhatsAppLogs` | Outbound WhatsApp |
| `twilioFeatureLogs` | Debugger webhook, verify, voice, other |
| `twilioComplianceLogs` | Security-relevant GRC rows (dry-run, auth fail, blocked/filtered, etc.) |

Retention: diagnostic body **30 days**; security metadata **90 days**; compliance metadata up to **7 years**. Phones masked + hashed; never log Auth Token / full Account SID.

## Master Admin UI

- Top-level **Twilio** tab group with subtabs: `twilioSmsLogs`, `twilioWhatsAppLogs`, `twilioFeatureLogs`
- **ShoutOuts → Twilio Compliance** for `twilioComplianceLogs` (GRC only — not operational traffic)

## Club Admin UI

Advertising → Messaging logs shows SMS + WhatsApp filtered by `clubLocationId`. Same rows appear on Master Admin Twilio tabs.

## Forbidden

- Do not treat dry-run as delivered success for marketing tests
- Do not put Auth Token or full Account SID in Firestore logs
- Do not put these design notes in FloqAi help bodies
